Package: mscc-firmware
Version: 1.0.1
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Multus SDR / MSCC Linux <local@localhost>
Installed-Size: 4500
Suggests: mscc
Homepage: https://local/mscc
Description: Multus/Proficio application firmware for USB bootloader upload
 Prebuilt PSoC application firmware (.cyacd and .hex) for eight radios.
 Built on Shack (Keil / PSoC Creator); this package redistributes those
 artifacts only. Optional — not part of the mscc servers package.
 .
 Files: /usr/share/mscc/firmware/<RadioName>/<Name>-YYYYMMDD.cyacd and .hex
 (one of each per radio).
 Radios: Proficio-Legacy, Proficio-MKII-PTT, Proficio-MKII-ATU,
 Geminus-Legacy, Geminus-MKII, Ultimus-Legacy, Ultimus-MKII-ATU,
 Ultimus-MKII-PTT.
 .
 USB Bootloader Load File defaults to this folder when installed.
 Install with: sudo apt install ./mscc-firmware_1.0.1_all.deb
 (or ./mscc-firmware_*_all.deb).
